<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/ComplexAGalactosylatedNGlycanMoiety> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> "biantennary complex N-glycan moiety that has no galactose residues as parts"@en-US .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/ComplexAGalactosylatedNGlycanMoiety> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/semiFormalNaturalLanguageDefinition> "every instance of 'complex agalactosylated N-glycan moiety' is defined as exactly an instance of 'biantennary complex N-glycan moiety' that 'has proper continuant part at all times' no 'galactose residue'" .
