<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/ComplexFucosylatedNGlycanMoiety> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/BiantennaryComplexNGlycanMoiety> .
