<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/ComplexGalactosylatedNGlycanMoiety> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> "https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/MolecularEntity/"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
